<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Computing scientist and infrastructure engineer.</h1>
    <p class="lede">I have spent fifteen years in Linux systems, networking, cloud and research computing. Today I am the technical lead for a university's HPC infrastructure: setting technical strategy, owning the stack, driving procurement and working with technology partners and vendors.</p>
  </div>
